      "annotation_text": "Serum electrolytes (sodium, potassium), creatinine, creatine kinase, gamma-glutamyltransferase (ɣGT), aspartate aminotransferase (AST), alanine transaminase (ALT), alkaline phosphatase (ALP), C-Reactive Protein (CRP), albumin, total bilirubin, glucose (non-fasting).",
      "marker_locations": [
